{"parse": {"title": "试做型“星锑”播放器", "pageid": 105855, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div style=\"user-select:none; pointer-events:none; position:relative; z-index:-1;\"></div><div class=\"antique-content\"><div class=\"antique-img\"><div style=\"margin-top:-13%;\"><img alt=\"试做型“星锑”播放器\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/88/Antique-v2a8_antique_icon_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"试做型“星锑”播放器\" width=\"700\" height=\"728\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"700\" data-file-height=\"728\" /></div><div style=\"position:absolute;width: 40%;height: 34%;right:20%;top: 76%;text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Signature-501206.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/13/Signature-501206.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"253\" height=\"253\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"253\" data-file-height=\"253\" /></div></div><div style=\"max-width:600px; margin: 35px 20px 0 20px; text-shadow: 1px 1px 5px black;\">“星锑”播放器的试做款，科算中心在第四十二次实验失败后将研究重心从放大音量转向了扩张磁场，这件装置才终于顺利完成了使命。<br />现作为纪念品赠予司辰，附赠一张纪念唱片。<div class=\"test-hide hide-m grey-small\" style=\"float:right; margin-top:40px\">编号ID：281001</div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E9.99.84.E5.8A.A0.E5.89.A7.E6.83.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"附加剧情\">附加剧情</span></h2><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\" style=\"transform:translateY(0); gap:20px; position:relative; flex-direction:row-reverse; margin-bottom:0.8em;\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzineihuanghun\"><img alt=\"0xiangzineihuanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>好了，测试，麦克风测试……摇起来吧！宝贝！扭动并呐喊吧～呼……这才叫唱片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>所有人都在听么？这台看起来还挺酷的唱片机本海盗拿走了！就当是我这段时间安分守己的报酬！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>以及对于拿到这张唱片的人。好吧，维尔汀，或许你现在心情复杂……不过我们都还活着，摇滚也还活着，这就算是好事了！振作起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>星锑，你为什么拿着试验机？那是拉普拉斯的公共财产，把它放回仓库去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>你正在录音么？给司辰的纪念品？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-310701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>咳哼，司辰，这次的南极之旅验证了很多猜想，你可能需要些时间去接受，但总的来说，我们的进展喜人，期待今后有更多与你合作的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>还有星锑，你现在就给我去补上物资申请表。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312019.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-312019.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312019.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312019.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-312019.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312019.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-312019.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312019.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>可以请你把麦克风拿高些么？是的，再高些！辛苦你了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312017.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-312017.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312017.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312017.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-312017.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312017.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-312017.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312017.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>维尔汀，你在听么？现在我们算是同一个探险队的了，下次还要去冒险的话，可以叫上我，我会载你一程的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-524413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-524413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-524413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>像这样通过其他媒介与您交流，给了我更多斟酌词句的空间，我似乎有些喜欢这种方式，司辰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"5244114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-5244114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-5244114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"5244114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-5244114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-5244114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-5244114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-5244114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>无论如何，司辰，我们再次挫败了重塑之手的计划，同样我们也可以再次击败阿尔卡纳，再次找到兀尔德女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-524413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-524413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-524413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>所以，我希望您能放松一些，享受一次胜利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-624920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-624920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-624920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>请等一下，这份送给维尔汀的录音，我也可以说两句么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-624920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-624920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-624920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>不要惊慌，我目前不是你们的敌人，还没有类似的命令被下达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-624920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-624920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-624920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……维尔汀，比起牺牲，你是否更喜欢下令要别人活下去？也许我们能在往后的共事中弄清这……不，忘了它吧，希望你不用再遇见我。</div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E6.9D.A5.E6.BA.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"来源\">来源</span></h2><div class=\"no-indent\" style=\"text-align:center; max-width:500px\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E2%80%9C%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E2%80%9D\" title=\"不规范“实验”\"><img alt=\"不规范“实验”.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E2%80%9C%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E2%80%9D.jpg/500px-%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E2%80%9C%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E2%80%9D.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E2%80%9C%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E2%80%9D.jpg/750px-%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E2%80%9C%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E2%80%9D.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E2%80%9C%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E2%80%9D.jpg/1000px-%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E2%80%9C%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E2%80%9D.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n全服在「<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8D%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E2%80%9C%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E2%80%9D\" title=\"不规范“实验”\">不规范“实验”</a>」中累计探索进度达到100%时获得</div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "收藏品"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">试做型“星锑”播放器 <small style=\"color: grey\"></small></span></span>"}}